  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 2026-05-10 - 字节加码算力-8家核心企业\n\n资料脑图｜按原文结构生成",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "1",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 风险提示\n- 本视频为短视频投研内容，未核验公司数据。\n- 公司名称来自视频口播和机器转写校正，不代表已核验事实。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "“字节2000亿AI资本开支”是本页最高优先级核验项；若该前提不成立，整条推导需要降权。",
      "x": -79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "所有结论需回到公司公告和财报核实。",
      "x": 79,
      "y": -665,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "2",
      "styleAttributes": {
        "shape": "rounded-rectangle"
      }
